    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that queries documents using a specific external provider. The provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the external provider, which is a managed NoSQL database service provided by AWS. I will use the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with DynamoDB. </thinking>\n\n",
        "time": {
