    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that fetches a document by identifier from a managed NoSQL store, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Amazon DynamoDB is a popular managed NoSQL store, and I will use its Python SDK, boto3, to interact with it. The boto3 library will be imported, and the DynamoDB client will be used to fetch the document. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the DynamoDB client. </thinking>\n",
