      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the upsert_document.py file that upserts a JSON document by its primary identifier using a concrete external provider, I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the external provider. This choice is based on its widespread use and the availability of a Python SDK. The code will import the boto3 library to interact with DynamoDB, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
